. cap program drop finertreatmentwindow

. program define finertreatmentwindow
  1. syntax  [, Tmax(real 16) Tmin(real 12) WMAXcent(real 500) WMINcent(real 40
> 0) WINCrement(real 25) ]  
  2. 
. local wmaxcent2 = `wmaxcent' - `wincrement'
  3. local wincrement2 = `wincrement' * 2
  4.                         
. 
. 
